      "message": "What about all the other tools?\n\nFor most of the targets CROSS_COMPILE looks like:\nCROSS_COMPILE\u003d/opt/coreboot-sdk/bin/arm-eabi-\nThis comes from a combination of:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay/+/19b1b91d/chromeos-base/chromeos-ec/chromeos-ec-9999.ebuild#85\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/d2602418/core/cortex-m0/build.mk#10\n\nThe tests have CROSS_COMPILE set empty here:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/d2602418/Makefile.rules#93\n\nI was thinking about grabbing the prefix from BUILDCC/HOSTCC and using it for CROSS_COMPILE instead of an empty string.\nSee: https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay/+/19b1b91d/chromeos-base/chromeos-ec/chromeos-ec-9999.ebuild#95",
      "parentUuid": "722c850b_456d9fb0",
